Depends: bash, libc6, libfontconfig1, libgcc-s1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, perl
Suggests: i3-wm
Maintainer: instantOS <hello@instantos.io>
Description: Dynamic menu for X11 and Wayland
